<Base title="Methodology" description="How Ohmetry calculators are built and tested.">
  <h1>Methodology</h1>
  <p>Every calculator is a standalone function with automated tests. Test cases come from worked examples in published standards or from hand calculation, and the expected value is written next to each test.</p><p>Code tables are stored as data with the section number cited. We link to the section and explain it in our own words; we do not reproduce code text.</p><p>Found an error? See <a href='/contact/'>Contact</a>. Corrections will be logged on this page.</p><h2>Corrections log</h2><p>None yet.</p>
</Base>
